\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She <span class=\\\"strong\\\">must</span> have felt like he didn't care about her. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"should <br> could <br> might  <br>would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To express suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"modal + verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You <span class=\\\"strong\\\">should</span> come to a compromise.<br/>That <span class=\\\"strong\\\">would</span> be a good place to start, don't you think?<br/>He<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> should</span> have done it a while ago.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"supposed to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To express expectation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"supposed to + verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm <span class=\\\"strong\\\">supposed to</span> interview a few applicants next week.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Negative Questions To Encourage Agreement"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Negative questions are another way to confirm information you already know. Using a variety of structures gives your speaking a more sophisticated feel. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Negative questions can begin with the structures: <br> <br> <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think ...? <br>Isn't it right that ... ? <br> You don't think ... ? <br>Wouldn't it be better if ... ? <br>Doesn't that mean ... ?</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Don't you think you should come to a compromise?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "You don't think you should take a step back, perhaps? "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"c