ant manager will solve my problem."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "controlling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "dominating and commanding the actions of someone else"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I guess I could let go of my controlling habits ..."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le01ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make profiles of your classmates and put them in a pile."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Get three profiles of other classmates."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Try to convince your partner that one of the profiles is the right person for them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use encouraging agreement language and feeling and sensation language. \u201cHe seems like ... \u201d to convince your partner."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about feelings and sensations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I  express possibility, certainty, suggestions and expectations. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I encourage agreement. "}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about feelings and sensations."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express possibility, certainty, suggestions and expectations. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can encourage agreement. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " How stressed out are you by work or school?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think you have a good work-life balance? Why or why not?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group